1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,018
Inkanyamba: whoever he used to be no longer matters.

2
00:00:03,018 --> 00:00:05,057
He has become a creature of pure wrath.

3
00:00:05,277 --> 00:00:06,557
Here's how he plays.

4
00:00:07,367 --> 00:00:11,172
Put the Killer Wrath card out with a tracking marker on level two, and add both

5
00:00:11,172 --> 00:00:13,340
Atonement Action cards to the Action Tableau.

6
00:00:14,167 --> 00:00:18,241
Inkanyamba's anger is tracked on the Killer Wrath card, from level one to ten.

7
00:00:18,461 --> 00:00:22,865
When told to Increase or Decrease Killer Wrath, move the marker up or down that many

8
00:00:22,865 --> 00:00:25,224
levels. It never goes below one or above ten.

9
00:00:25,444 --> 00:00:29,227
When told to Unleash Killer Wrath, look at the current level and apply everything

10
00:00:29,227 --> 00:00:29,881
printed on it.

11
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:35,011
Depending on the level, an Unleash can raise your Horror, heal Inkanyamba, make him

12
00:00:35,011 --> 00:00:37,868
take an extra Killer Action, or a combination of these.

13
00:00:38,088 --> 00:00:41,980
The higher his Wrath, the nastier it gets, so the key to this killer is keeping

14
00:00:41,980 --> 00:00:43,507
Wrath low before it boils over.

15
00:00:44,333 --> 00:00:47,299
Atonement Action cards are your main way to calm him down.

16
00:00:47,519 --> 00:00:49,787
With one success, lower Killer Wrath by one.

17
00:00:49,787 --> 00:00:53,755
With two, lower it by half, rounded up. With three or more successes, drop it

18
00:00:53,755 --> 00:00:54,580
straight to one.

19
00:00:54,800 --> 00:00:58,235
At the Sacred Groves you can use Atonement on Divine Wrath instead.

20
00:00:59,067 --> 00:01:02,843
His 'Wrath of' Terror cards Unleash his Wrath, and some push it even higher.

21
00:01:03,063 --> 00:01:07,183
Wrath of Death raises it by your current health, so being at full health hurts here.

22
00:01:07,183 --> 00:01:09,783
If there are no Victims left, it targets you instead.

23
00:01:10,003 --> 00:01:14,292
His Violent Tantrum Finale Unleashes Wrath and raises it by three, and keeps nudging

24
00:01:14,292 --> 00:01:16,232
it up whenever it falls to one or two.

25
00:01:17,067 --> 00:01:20,492
Volatile Temper adds a Horror roll at the end of every Upkeep.

26
00:01:20,492 --> 00:01:22,315
A bad result Unleashes his Wrath.

27
00:01:22,535 --> 00:01:26,888
His Epic Dark Power, Dark Lightning: whenever he kills a Victim, he also kills a

28
00:01:26,888 --> 00:01:30,044
second Victim in the same or an adjacent space, if he can.

29
00:01:30,867 --> 00:01:35,147
A few tips. At the Sacred Groves two Wrath tracks stack, and it's the hardest box in

30
00:01:35,147 --> 00:01:37,032
the game, so try him elsewhere first.

31
00:01:37,252 --> 00:01:41,945
Atonement is unreliable on one or two dice, so get Horror down first and roll three.

32
00:01:42,165 --> 00:01:45,088
Look for weapons that hurt him and lower Wrath at once.

33
00:01:45,088 --> 00:01:47,693
And beware Savage Whirlwind, his toughest Finale.

34
00:01:47,693 --> 00:01:48,224
Good luck.

